{"id":"15bc9a2ed3c9c46d","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-forcing-elimination.md","title":"Forcing Elimination","display":"thm-forcing-elimination — Forcing Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-forcing-elimination","aliases":["58-thm-forcing-elimination"],"display":"thm-forcing-elimination — Forcing Elimination","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-forcing-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-forcing-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-forcing-elimination — Forcing Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,G,N\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,G,N\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> are the typed predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span> is the fixed membership-language theory ZFC without Power Set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> is the canonical six-argument forcing relation</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}(\\vec\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}(\\vec\\tau)\\)</span> is the componentwise forcing-name valuation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,n,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Name}(\\vec\\tau(i),\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall G,N\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\n\\land p\\in G\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\to\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(s(x_i)=\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}(\\vec\\tau(i))\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\Bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,n,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Name}(\\vec\\tau(i),\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall G,N\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\n\\land p\\in G\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\to\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(s(x_i)=\\operatorname{val}_{G,\\mathbb P}(\\vec\\tau(i))\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\Bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the semantic elimination form of the canonical forcing relation. The ground model, order, name tuple, generic extension, selected satisfaction recursion, and parameter assignment are all explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06